sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Stops analytics
    participant SC as Stops Controller
    participant ST as SQL table: stops
    participant CA as SQL table: causes

    Admin->>UI: Open stops analytics page
    Admin->>UI: Select start date, end date and team
    UI->>SC: Request daily stops summary
    SC->>ST: Aggregate stops by production day
    SC->>CA: Read TRS impact per cause
    ST-->>SC: Stop count and downtime totals
    CA-->>SC: Cause TRS flags
    SC-->>UI: Daily summary rows
    UI->>UI: Calculate/display TRS and pagination
    UI-->>Admin: Show stops summary table

    alt Invalid range, no data or request error
        UI-->>Admin: Show validation, empty state or error message
    end
